WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.000
You have to know
how to handle pressure.

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:08.600
It's really important
because every day is different,

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.300
so you need to cope
with the pressure

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.900
and different situations
like special diets.
